{"strongs": "H8561", "word": "תִּמֹרָה", "translit": "tim.rah", "root": "תמר", "morph": "H:N-F", "pos": "noun feminine", "gloss": "palm(-tree), figure", "definition": "תִּמֹרָה 19 noun feminine palm(-tree), figure , as ornament; — ׳ ת Ezek 41:18 + ( van d. H. ׳ תִּמּ , so throughout); plural תִּמֹרֹת 1Kgs 6:29 + ( Gi ׳ תִּמּ ), תִּמֹרִים Ezek 40:16 +; suffix תִּימֹרָיו v Ezek 40:22 Qr ( Kt תימרו ); — palm-figure in Solomon's temple 1Kgs 6:29 ; 1Kgs 6:32 (twice in verse); 1Kgs 6:35 ; 1Kgs 7:36 ; 2Chr 3:5 in Ezekiel's temple Ezek 40:16 ; Ezek 40:22 ; Ezek 40:26 + 10 t. 40, 41.", "definition_html": "<h1><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB9199')\">BDB9199</entry> [<entry onclick=\"sn('H8561')\">H8561</entry>]</h1><div class=\"navigation\"><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB9198')\">BDB9198</entry> | BIBLICAL HEBREW | <entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB9200')\">BDB9200</entry></div><p> <bdbheb>תִּמֹרָה</bdbheb><sub>19</sub> <b>noun feminine</b> <highlightword>palm(-tree), figure</highlightword>, as ornament; — <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>ת</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ezek 41:18\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"41\" vBegin=\"18\" cEnd=\"41\" vEnd=\"18\" onclick=\"bcv(26,41,18)\">Ezek 41:18</ref> + (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('van d.H.')\">van d. H.</lookup> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>תִּמּ</bdbheb>, so throughout); plural <bdbheb>תִּמֹרֹת</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"1Kgs 6:29\" b=\"11\" cBegin=\"6\" vBegin=\"29\" cEnd=\"6\" vEnd=\"29\" onclick=\"bcv(11,6,29)\">1Kgs 6:29</ref> + (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Gi')\">Gi</lookup> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>תִּמּ</bdbheb>), <bdbheb>תִּמֹרִים</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ezek 40:16\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"40\" vBegin=\"16\" cEnd=\"40\" vEnd=\"16\" onclick=\"bcv(26,40,16)\">Ezek 40:16</ref> +; suffix <bdbheb>תִּימֹרָיו</bdbheb> v<ref ref=\"Ezek 40:22\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"40\" vBegin=\"22\" cEnd=\"40\" vEnd=\"22\" onclick=\"bcv(26,40,22)\">Ezek 40:22</ref> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Qr')\"><reflink>Qr</reflink></lookup> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Kt')\"><reflink>Kt</reflink></lookup> <bdbheb>תימרו</bdbheb